    "text": "1 days ago ATLANTA, Georgia — A teenager is dead after he was located with gunshot wounds in northwest Atlanta late Tuesday night, according to the Atlanta Police Department. Officers were called to Atlanta Fire Rescue Station 38 on Donald Lee Hollowell Parkway Northwest around 10:50 p.m. on Jan 13, where they located a 16-year-old male unresponsive. He was pronounced dead on the scene. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 16",
